From: Aspartame GTK4 migration
Subject: [PATCH] journal: attach rooted unparented views synchronously

JournalActivity builds its views after the JournalWindow is rooted. The
historical safety guard deferred every rooted widget, including views with no
parent, so set_canvas() looped forever and Journal rendered as a blank page.
Defer only a widget still attached to another parent; an unparented rooted
view can be appended safely to the intended area.

--- a/src/jarabe/journal/journalwindow.py
+++ b/src/jarabe/journal/journalwindow.py
@@ -79,1 +79,1 @@
-                if widget.get_root() is not None:
+                if widget.get_parent() is not None and widget.get_root() is not None:
